            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="destination-grid">

            <a href="#booking" class="destination-card">

                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533130061792-64b345e4a833?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85">

                <div class="destination-overlay">
                    <h3>Cox's Bazar</h3>
                    <p>The world's longest natural sea beach</p>
                </div>

            </a>


            <a href="#booking" class="destination-card">

                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544735716-392fe2489ffa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85">

                <div class="destination-overlay">
                    <h3>Sajek Valley</h3>
                    <p>Clouds, mountains & peaceful nature</p>
                </div>

            </a>


            <a href="#booking" class="destination-card">

                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516026672322-bc52d61a55d5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85">

                <div class="destination-overlay">
                    <h3>Sylhet</h3>
                    <p>Tea gardens, rivers & green landscapes</p>
                </div>

            </a>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- PACKAGES -->
<section class="packages" id="packages">

